      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَوِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Contracted in the bosom,</i> (K, TA,) <i>by
reason of disease therein,</i> (TA,) <i>so that his tongue
cannot explain for him,</i> (K,) or <i>so that his tongue
can hardly,</i> or <i>not at all, explain for him.</i> (TA.)
